'''The Mountaintop''' is a [[Location]] in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It is based on the {{zone|Mountain}}.

<!--{{RiftGuide||souls=10}}-->

== Features ==
'''The Mountaintop''' features many attractions. The player must have secured both the {{Item|Vampiric Timecharm}} and have a minimum of {{stat|rt|9:00}} remaining in order to access the location.

=== The 7th Sin ===
{{See also|Porhtal}}
One of [[Porhtal]]'s eyes, The 7th Sin, can be found on '''The  Mountaintop'''. The eye's condition is {{DarkRed|'''ROGUE'''}} by default, and can be defeated to gain a permanent {{stat|rt|+30}} and the ability to instantly teleport to it from [[Porhtal]] or any of their other eyes. Teleporting to The 7th Sin costs {{stat|rt|21m45s}} and can only be done if the player has enough time remaining.

=== Vending Machine ===
A '''Vending Machine''' can be found on '''The Mountaintop'''. Once a player pays {{Motes|1,000}}, it will dispense a potion with {{PotN|Gravity I}}, which increases the chances of {{MobSprite|Puff}}s spawning.

